Sonda-Huawei is a CLI latency and packet-loss probe utility tailored
for Huawei VRP edge devices (VRPv5 / VRPv8, NE40E, NetEngine,
CloudEngine, AR routers).

It originates ICMP ping tests from up to 5 different source IP addresses
simultaneously, allowing real-time comparison of latency, jitter and
packet loss across multiple upstream providers, BGP transits, and IX/PTT
links in multihoming border router scenarios.

WWW: https://github.com/cleberalves40/Sonda-Huawei
